  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "からだの　ひかりを　いってんに　あつめて\nちからを　はなつ。あいての　とくぼうを\nさげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "몸의 빛을 한곳에 모아서\n힘을 방출한다. 상대의\n특수방어를 떨어뜨릴 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "將身體的光芒\n聚集在一個點後釋放出去。\n有時會降低對手的特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur concentre son énergie lumineuse\net la fait exploser.\nPeut aussi baisser la Défense Spéciale de l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender sammelt Lichtenergie und feuert sie auf\neinmal ab. Senkt eventuell Spezial-Verteidigung des\nZieles.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario concentra toda la luz del cuerpo y la libera.\nPuede bajar la Defensa Especial del objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa attacca raccogliendo e rilasciando energia\nluminosa. Può ridurre la Difesa Speciale del bersaglio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user gathers all its light energy and releases it\nall at once. This may also lower the target’s\nSp. Def stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "体の　光を　一点に　集めて\n力を　放つ。\n相手の　特防を　さげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "将身体的光芒聚集在一点\n释放出去。\n有时会降低对手的特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario concentra toda la luz del cuerpo y la libera.\nPuede bajar la Defensa Especial del objetivo.",
